        "logo": "",
        "pretitle": "Two Platforms",
        "title_tag": "h1",
        "title": "Break Free from Complicated",
        "text_truncate_enable": false,
        "text": "<p>Whether you choose an OcuMow® that auto-charges or one that doesn't, set-up is minimal. With no app mapping, no boundary wire to lay. For the OcuMow® that auto-charges, even the installation of the charging station is as simple as plug-and-play.</p>",
        "button_style": "white",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_url": "",
