    "featured_text_with_image_EPkbXD": {
      "type": "featured-text-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "text_with_image_itPFRr": {
          "type": "text-with-image",
          "settings": {
            "align_content": "reverse",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_OcuMow_18_Robot_Mower_Charging_Station2.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "New",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "OcuMow® 18",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Independently navigates, mows and charges, boundary-wire free. With plug-and-play installation and vision technology, OcuMow® 18 saves time from the moment it's yours. For gardens up to 800m² with mostly well-defined borders and outdoor power.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "Watch Ad",
            "button_1_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/b21024e921804b4babf2e2e16e20cbb8.mp4",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_with_image_GhFjAd": {
          "type": "text-with-image",
          "settings": {
            "align_content": "reverse",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/OcuMow_16_robotic_mower_Screen.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Auto-Charging",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>In schedule mode, OcuMow® 18 operates automatically from dawn to dusk, recharging itself when the battery gets low. With OcuMow® 18 you can also customise when and how long you want your robot to be active using the simple dial and LCD screen interface.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_with_image_mymjeT": {
          "type": "text-with-image",
          "settings": {
            "align_content": "reverse",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_OcuMow_18_Robot_Mower_Charging_Station.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Plug and Play Charging System",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Simply plug the charger into an outdoor power socket, set the schedule and OcuMow® 18 will do the rest. No guide wires to lay or boundaries to map. The mower will use a combination of GPS positioning and the camera to find its way back to the charging station when its battery is low.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        }
      },
